<UseCase
  source="d2c"
  seoTitle="AI marketing for D2C & Shopify brands in India"
  seoDescription="An AI marketing team for D2C and Shopify brands: competitor watch, campaign and festival plans, on-brand posts with your real product photos and prices, publishing and click tracking. Plans from ₹999/month."
  eyebrow="For D2C & Shopify brands"
  title="Your whole marketing team,"
  accent="built around your catalogue."
  intro="AICMO watches competitors' offers, plans campaigns around your launches and festivals, turns your Shopify products into branded posts with the prices in your store, publishes to Instagram, Facebook and more, and shows which posts drove clicks."
  pains={[
    ['Hundreds of products, one founder', 'New drops, restocks, bestsellers, festive edits — there is always something to post and never time to post it.'],
    ['Wrong prices are expensive', 'A caption with an old price or a discount code you never created means refunds, angry DMs and lost trust.'],
    ['Designing every post', 'Opening Canva for every product photo is where good intentions go to die.'],
  ]}
  capabilities={[
    ['Shopify catalogue sync', 'Products, prices and stock are imported from your store and refreshed daily. Out-of-stock items are left out of new posts.'],
    ['Product photo cards', 'Your product photo, name and price on a clean branded card, sized for Instagram feed, X and Facebook. Free and unlimited.'],
    ['Captions that sell', 'Posts built on your Brand Brain: your fabrics, your craft, your customers, your tone — not generic "shop now" copy.'],
