    ['Tuesday', 'Seven drafts are waiting in your inbox with product cards attached. You fix one word and approve the rest in five minutes.'],
    ['Wednesday–Sunday', 'Posts go out at the times your channels are set to. Nothing publishes with a price that disagrees with your store.'],
    ['Next Monday', 'It reads how each post did and weights next week towards the formats and products that got the most saves and shares.'],
  ]}
