    { q: 'Do I need a Shopify store?', a: "No. Shopify stores get automatic catalogue import. If you sell elsewhere, add your products and offers to your Brand Brain's knowledge and upload your own photos." },
    { q: 'Will it use my real product photos?', a: "Yes. Photo cards use the images from your store. You can also upload your own shots or, with credits, generate an AI image for mood posts." },
